# Shared widgets first

Before creating any new widget:

1. Search `lib/presentations/widgets/` (badge, button, card, search, input, form_review, popup, state, …).
2. Reuse or extend what exists.
3. Feature-local widget only if truly feature-specific.
4. Promote to shared only when used (or clearly needed) in 2+ features.

Do not copy search bars, badges, shimmer cards, empty/error states per module.

Details: `.agents/rules/shared-widgets.md`
